[[0,1872177,0,3,1,2,"2017-05-19T23:05:39","LibertyInstituteCA","",[],"","The Progressives Will Not Stop Until We Make Them Stop","http://libertyinstitute.ca/the-progressives-will-not-stop-until-we-make-them-stop/","canadianpolitics"],[1,9174222,0,0,0,0,"2017-05-20T01:01:27","shorternet","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>If you are like many Canadians, you are tired of seeing your family, culture, business and way of life being relentlessly attacked by the degenerates who call themselves progressives or liberals.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>You do realize that you sound <em>exactly</em> like those progressives you're railing against when Stephen Harper was in power.... don't you?</p>\n<p>It's the same old story these days, when the Conservatives are in power the Liberals/progressives cry that the sky is falling and Canada is being ruined, and when the Liberals/progressives are in power Conservatives cry that the sky is falling and Canada is being ruined.</p>\n<p>.... and that whole degenerates part? Really?</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The one thing that all progressives have in common is the drive to reinvent every single western society from the top down. \n</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Society has always reinvented itself, it's part of the natural evolution of society. Some realize that and accept change, others, like those who said that the wheel was a poor replacement for the sledge and would bring nothing ruin among the tribe.... well, they're generally just unhappy.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Their aim is to create a Marxist Utopia on earth.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Hyper-partisan talking points play well with the believers, but not so well with the masses - which, it behooves me to add, voted overwhelmingly for those Liberal and progressive parties you are so unhappy with.</p>\n<p>Do you think that sort of rhetoric is going to convince any of them to come over to your side?</p>"]]
[[0,1872178,0,6,1,5,"2017-05-19T23:05:53","LibertyInstituteCA","",[],"","The Progressives Will Not Stop Until We Make Them Stop","http://libertyinstitute.ca/the-progressives-will-not-stop-until-we-make-them-stop/","politics"],[1,9174306,0,0,0,0,"2017-05-20T01:07:43","DeplorableMeep","",[],"<p>Stop voting for them &amp; fire them from their positions in government. They make us miserable anyway because they are slow with everything.</p>"],[1,9174436,0,0,0,0,"2017-05-20T01:18:07","Zaqwert","",[],"<p>It's going to take a civil war sadly. Maybe 10, 20, 50 years away, but it's coming.</p>"],[1,9174532,0,1,0,1,"2017-05-20T01:26:26","0rion","",[],"<p>I think we need to start holding protests outside the homes of politicians and media personalities. And we need to practice <strong>REAL</strong> civil disobedience in these cases, rather than adopt BLM style tactics. We need to put the fear of God into the elites. A nationwide general strike would also be helpful if key industries like trucking participated. Doing these things will pressure them to make a move. When they finally move against protesters who are TRULY non violent, we will have the justification we need to fight back. This country hasn't seen a real grassroots protest movement in a long time, just manufactured garbage like OWS and BLM. I'd say we are long overdue.</p>"],[1,9174871,0,0,0,0,"2017-05-20T01:46:01","memyuhself","",[],"<p>the Progressives are all violent communist that are in desperate need of a helicopter ride.</p>"]]
