[[0,1872185,0,4,0,4,"2017-05-19T23:08:38","Lazuli","",[],"<p>it's so obvious my friends all hate me. they talk about how i never come to meet ups and hang out. i know it. make bs excuses every time. what's wrong with me. an easy way to get out and socialise and have fun, and i stay home and play games, fantasise about what i could have been, and feel bad for myself. why can't i just be rebekah..</p>","sigh .....","","Lazuli"],[1,9172877,0,2,0,2,"2017-05-19T23:19:16","Hey_Sunshine","",[],"<p>Because you're, You. So ... get the fuck over yourself and get your ass in gear</p>"],[1,9173367,0,2,0,2,"2017-05-19T23:54:31","William_Wallace","[e]",[],"<p>Sounds like you don't do those things because you don't want to. Nothing wrong with that. Find something you do want to do and do that, If you can, find people who want to do that too. Never get caught up on &quot;friends&quot;. Just because you know people doesn't make them your friend, and even if they were your friends it's likely one day that will change.</p>\n<p>Also, some people don't like to have &quot;fun&quot;. My favorite things to do don't involve smiling. Sounds like you are hungry for substance. Read on stoicism, and Buddhism. Get in Nature. Find a high point and look into the distance. </p>\n<p>The best cures for depression are nutrition, exercise, and meditation. You also sound frustrated. Get mad and embrace an outlet. Find some violence. If you like to fantasize, then start to write. Grow something, create something, build something. Then keep it to yourself and see that there is no validation from others. </p>\n<p>Don't concern yourself with &quot;could have been&quot;, there is no such thing. Don't think in such large terms like judging your entirety of existence through someone else's mind, we tend to imagine the worst when we do that. Let go.</p>\n<p>When I worked at a hospital we had an expression there, &quot;any day you wake up is a good day&quot;. Learn to enjoy breathing. </p>\n<p>Plus, rebekah might get cancer young and die so..</p>\n<p>watch this: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OX0OARBqBp0\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OX0OARBqBp0</a></p>"],[1,9174065,0,0,0,0,"2017-05-20T00:49:16","carlip","",[],"<p>its probably because you are the kind of faggot that make an entire subverse about yourself?</p>"]]
