[[0,1872193,0,4,1,3,"2017-05-19T23:12:40","V____Z","[e]",[],"<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IvxFzcAoONo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IvxFzcAoONo</a></p>\n<p><em>Began a few minutes ago, but you can rewind and start from the beginning. Starts at 3:00 in.</em></p>\n<p>From YouTube:</p>\n<p>Welcome return guest and new friend of the show, Liz Crokin. Liz will join Doug and Joe for part one of a two part series on the massive fake stream coverup of the murder of DNC insider Seth Rich.</p>\n<p>Tonight, Liz will engage premiere father/son investigative team, Douglas J Hagmann and Joe Hagmann with much of the background and many of the intricacies, that you may be unaware of, regarding the murder of Seth Rich. Liz began her career on the crime beat, covering the Chicago PD and when Doug and she get down to brass tacks, you will be on your way to total addiction to this multifaceted case. I just spoke with Liz and am not at liberty to write what she told me; suffice it to say, you do not want to miss this half hour.</p>\n<p>Liz will rejoin us Monday evening for part two, at which time she intends to divulge her personal investigative findings based on her personal contacts with many individuals who knew Mr Rich personally.</p>\n<p>Liz Crokin began her journey at the University of Iowa where she received a bachelor’s in journalism and political science. She took advantage of living in the first-in-the-nation caucus state to work on John Kasich and George W. Bush’s presidential campaigns. Her experience landed her an internship working for Bill O’Reilly at Fox News Channel and then to Washington DC where she interned for the State Department’s White House Correspondent which planted her in the White House daily.</p>","Live: Seth Rich, The Murder of America: Liz Crokin on the Hagmann Report","","pizzagate"],[1,9172901,0,1,0,1,"2017-05-19T23:21:03","privatepizza","",[],"<p>Excellent, thanks for this! Tuning in.</p>"],[2,9173134,9172901,1,0,1,"2017-05-19T23:38:01","V____Z","",[],"<p>Can't wait for part 2!</p>"],[1,9173137,0,1,0,1,"2017-05-19T23:38:21","lightindarkness","[e]",[],"<p>His Name was Seth Rich</p>"],[1,9173723,0,0,1,-1,"2017-05-20T00:23:35","equineluvr","",[],"<p>Hagemanns (Js) have ZERO credibility after they made a big deal about the &quot;piano photo.&quot; The pic was given to AJ who made a big deal out of it. (It turned out to be NOTHING--- the child was CLOTHED.)</p>"],[2,9174192,9173723,0,0,0,"2017-05-20T00:59:28","V____Z","",[],"<p>This isn't the Hagmanns, it is one of the most respected pizzagate researchers around. The Hagmanns barely say a word. So I'm not sure what your point is?</p>"]]
